\",\"question\":\"For Story 2, should the current selection interpretations be accepted, and must CompactReceipt expose an explicit total token count field?\",\"defaultRecommendation\":\"Do not accept yet. Require the selection behavior to match the literal current story/design unless the story/design is explicitly amended, and require an explicit totalTokens field in CompactReceipt to satisfy AC-2.4.\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier outcome is needs-human-ruling with status needs-user-decision at packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/004-verify.json.\",\"SV-02-001: implementation adds selection interpretations for smooth-obligate turns beyond share, partial-chunk retreat, and no brief oversized-loner while story-file says Spec Deviations: None.\",\"SV-02-002: AC-2.4 requires actual per-band and total token counts, but CompactReceipt exposes per-band tokens and tailTokens without an explicit total token count.\",\"Both gates passed: pnpm run green-verify and pnpm run verify-all.\"],\"allowedResponses\":[\"accept current selection interpretations and derived total token count is sufficient\",\"accept current selection interpretations but require explicit totalTokens quick-fix\",\"reject current selection interpretations and require literal story/design selection rules; derived total token count is sufficient\",\"reject current selection interpretations and require literal story/design selection rules plus explicit totalTokens quick-fix\"]},\"recommendedImplLeadAction\":\"ask-ruling\"},\"startedFromPrimitiveArtifacts\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/001-story-validate.json\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"story-run-current\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/03-thread-views-and-smart-compact/artifacts/02-smart-compact/story-lead/0