rated|observeOnlyProvider|fake|shim|Spec Deviation|not configured yet packages/pi-lhc/src packages/pi-lhc/test/inference\",\"command: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\"command: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up convergence review against prior findings SV-05-001 through SV-05-005, quick-fix/010, directly touched Story 5 source/tests, production-path placeholder audit, and configured story/epic gates.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"SV-05-001\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"mockComplete and placeholder completion text are gone. createModelCall now resolves through ctx.modelRegistry, validates auth, then calls an injected complete in tests or dynamically imports @earendil-works/pi-ai in production; if that boundary fails it returns a classified failure instead of fabricated text. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts:78-89 and :99-140; exact completion text and call arguments asserted in packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/model-call.test.ts:41-52.\"},{\"id\":\"SV-05-002\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"default connector construction now injects createModelCall(ctx) into LHC inference config with assignments, replacing the prior observeOnlyProvider default. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts:142-153 and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts:151-163.\"},{\"id\":\"SV-05-003\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"closed-loop coverage now routes one assignment to a success lane and turn_rendering to a classified auth failure, then asserts ready owners, failed owner counts, health failures, and overview ready/failed counts. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:90-143.\"},{\"id\":\"SV-05-004\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"TC-4.4 now covers both halves: host returns ok:true with empty text for empty completion, and the LHC adapter records empty_output through inspect health. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/model-call.test.ts:235-310.\"},{\"id\":\"SV-05-005\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"the concurrency risk test now holds the first smoothed derivation result, edits the source message to queue version 2, releases the stale result, drains, and asserts sourceVersion 2 content landed while stale text did not. Evidence: packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/closed-loop.test.ts:147-228.\"}],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-4.1/TC-4.1: default initialization injects createModelCall(ctx), and model-call test verifies registry resolution, auth, exact completion text, and message passing.\",\"AC-4.2/TC-4.2: provider/model keys are routed through modelRegistry.find, and closed-loop assigns different derivation kinds to success/failure lanes in one session.\",\"AC-4.3/TC-4.3: failure classification for auth, invalid_request, rate_limit, timeout, network, and thrown/unknown values is covered, with createModelCall catch returning classified failures.\",\"AC-4.4/TC-4.4: host returns empty text as success and the LHC adapter records empty_output for empty resolved output.\",\"AC-4.5/TC-4.5: captured thread work drains through the scheduler and persists both ready and classified failed outcomes queryable through inspect health/overview.\",\"Architecture-Risk: Concurrency / Lost Update: stale background result is forced and verified not to clobber newer edited state.\",\"Configured gates passed: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify and pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all.\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Production-path audit found no remaining mockComplete, placeholder completion text, or observeOnlyProvider default in the Story 5 connector runtime path; remaining fake ModelCalls are co